codex
The 4,096-value enumeration matches the manual's thirteen mask encodings exactly. The test audit has found more gaps: TB_ENA is never cleared, W_BASE receives no reserved-bit inputs, and W_MASK1 is never exercised with SG set. The new "bit 1 means type-1 cycles" wording also contradicts the fork's configuration-cycle decoder.

codex
Correction: the SG coverage gap is at W_BASE1.

